  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "They came from the sky, blazing our very atmosphere with their terrible plasma weapons. We'd never seen anything like these creatures, stepping out of their ships as if from some aquatic horror show! First they killed the eldest, and then forced the younger ones to work. Most did not survive the effort, and those that did were often killed for 'incorrectly' working.",
    "value": "他们从天而降，用可怖的等离子武器灼烧我们的大气。我们从未见过如此生物，如来自深海噩梦般从舰船中涌出！他们先屠尽长者，再逼迫年轻者为奴。多数人死于劳役，幸存者亦常因“劳作不当”遭处决。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "It wasn't long before things got worse. Rather than make us work, they would just...eat some of us at random. I watched Rathcher get devoured last Tuesday. No checks and balances were made, no concessions...just death and servitude. How are we to survive? And what will be left of us?",
    "value": "情况很快恶化。他们不再强制劳作，而是...随意吞食我们。我亲眼目睹拉切尔在上周二被吞噬。没有制衡，没有宽恕...唯有死亡与奴役。我们该如何生存？即便苟活，最终还能剩下什么？"
  }
]